#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Claudia, Claude's cousin, says something in the terminal.

  claudia                 her favourite line
  claudia some text       she says your text
  echo text | claudia     she says what you pipe in

She is pixel art drawn with half blocks: true colour when the terminal sets
COLORTERM=truecolor, 256 colours otherwise, and grey shades with NO_COLOR or
when the output is not a terminal. In a terminal she types her line while
talking, blinks, winks and sends a few hearts up, and then she farts: a green
cloud puffs up beside her, stinks for a while and drifts off. Otherwise she is
printed once, standing still.
"""
import collections
import os
import shutil
import stat
import sys
import textwrap
import time

